      "patientRole": "A 62-year-old woman with cancer at the back of the throat, who starts six weeks of radiotherapy with chemotherapy in two weeks. She has lost 4 kg in the last two months. The team has suggested placing a feeding tube into the stomach through the tummy, called a gastrostomy, before treatment starts. She has not yet decided.",
